{"login": "juntyr", "location": "FI", "commits": [{"sha": "c8c3023a114aeacb97e130a60eff779f9c7cb539", "message": "Minimal support for threads partitioning (#277)\n\n* API improvements for partitioning + MPI probes\r\n\r\n* Implement simple votes for threads partitioning\r\n\r\n* Reduce code duplication in MPI partitioning\r\n\r\n* Implement migration and buffered speciation/dispersal reporting for threads partitioning\r\n\r\n* Implement progress report + termination wait for threads partitioning\r\n\r\n* Implement sync progress for threads partitioning\r\n\r\n* Refactor rustcoalescence dispatch to push partitioning later\r\n\r\n* Initial draft for partition args broadcast using Clone\r\n\r\n* Add minimal partitioning folding support\r\n\r\n* Integrate threads partitioning with rustcoalescence\r\n\r\n* Early progress on MPI result folding\r\n\r\n* Implement MPI partitioning result reduction\r\n\r\n* Remove now extraneous time-steps reduction\r\n\r\n* Make use of some Arc<[T]>: RustToCuda\r\n\r\n* Begin drafting a packed separable alias dispersal sampler\r\n\r\n* Implement separable packaged alias dispersal sampler\r\n\r\n* Switch to using the packed separable alias dispersal sampler, as it is general and optimised for all cases\r\n\r\n* Integrate rustcoalescence with new hack-free per-scenario dispersal sampler\r\n\r\n* Switch in-memory dispersal samplers to ArcArray2D\r\n\r\n* Refactor InMemoryDispersalSampler checked construction\r\n\r\n* Fix Array2D doc tests\r\n\r\n* Address some review comments\r\n\r\n* Fix two spelling issues\r\n\r\n* Fix event log sublog partitioning\r\n\r\n* Some more event log recorder improvements\r\n\r\n* Extensive local partition lifetime refactoring ... not yet sure if it's worth it\r\n\r\n* Fix event log config for MPI\r\n\r\n* Partially revert local partition lifetime refactoring\r\n\r\n* Fix threads partitioning deadlock on async wait vote\r\n\r\n* Add utility error when using MPI with non-MPI partitioning\r\n\r\n* Fix packed separable alias dispersal sampler\r\n\r\n* Final clean-up fixes\r\n\r\n* Fix SeparableAliasSelfDispersal CUDA repr", "created_at": "2024-06-03T08:59:57Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "92d8ef16540a935ad8b72c33a1bbfe7e47e35445", "message": "Remove oracle knowledge of local partition before partitioning", "created_at": "2024-05-22T09:46:29Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "134149a9f738a594609616556775b81603029480", "message": "Install CUDA in rustdoc CI", "created_at": "2024-05-20T15:15:52Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab3a275dee3cb901c71fe95a9ed4ba7d54cc465a", "message": "Upgrade to async-capable (for kernel launches and memory transfers) rust-cuda (#276)\n\n* Initial progress towards using rust-cuda with async\r\n\r\nSome progress\r\n\r\nFurther async integration progress, rustcoalescence fails to compile\r\n\r\nSome progress with dispatch coersion\r\n\r\nSmall cleanup\r\n\r\nCleanup cuda algorithm coersion\r\n\r\nSome more cleanup\r\n\r\nAdd back missing Backup for SeaHash and WyHash rngs\r\n\r\nFix CUDA kernel extraneous pub exports\r\n\r\nMinor improvement of the event buffer hack\r\n\r\nRemove unused control_flow_enum feature\r\n\r\nRevert Copy for [Indexed]Location\r\n\r\nRevert new clone\r\n\r\nUpdate to rust-cuda with async kernel launch async return\r\n\r\nUpdate to latest rust-cuda\r\n\r\nFix rustfmt\r\n\r\nTemporary fix to allow CUDA algorithm linking\r\n\r\nSmall cleanup, mostly of unused clippy allows\r\n\r\nSmall improvement to CUDA EventBuffer\r\n\r\nTry trait-based kernel signature check\r\n\r\nUpdate rust-toolchain\r\n\r\nFix clippy lints\r\n\r\nTry with const match instead\r\n\r\nTry with memcmp intrinsic\r\n\r\nTry out experimental const-type-layout with compression\r\n\r\nTry interning all const layout strings\r\n\r\nTry check\r\n\r\nTry check again\r\n\r\n* Small fixes after rebase\r\n\r\n* Use cuda with (hopefully) much faster type checks\r\n\r\n* Try with llvm-bitcode-linker\r\n\r\n* Upgrade to latest ptx-builder\r\n\r\n* Fix codecov action\r\n\r\n* Fix RUSTFLAGS merging for ptx kernels in codecov CI\r\n\r\nhttps://blog.rust-lang.org/inside-rust/2023/08/24/cargo-config-merging.html\r\nhttps://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/config.html#command-line-overrides\r\n\r\n* Update const-type-layout", "created_at": "2024-05-20T15:13:14Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0602676d938df4014cacbfb2ce7e38eadd20350f", "message": "Reduce CRON frequency to once per month", "created_at": "2024-05-18T12:33:54Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6c31ad6b2de1a38d6167e33430c86d0edf206325", "message": "Upgrade MSRV to 1.79-nightly + update dependencies", "created_at": "2024-05-18T12:13:16Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cea74d72dddc65302d91e600325896e853e252f6", "message": "Add almost-infinite scenario with Clark2Dt dispersal (#273)\n\nCo-authored-by: Nicol\u00e1s Firbas <nicolas.firbas@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* Sketch out Clark scenario code skeleton\r\n\r\n* Implement Clark2Dt dispersal using inverse sampling\r\n\r\n* Implement Clark2Dt self-dispersal probability using numerical integration\r\n\r\n* Generalise Clark2Dt to p/=0 + add tests\r\n\r\n* Make p=1 the default\r\n\r\n* Merge spatially explicit scenario configs\r\n\r\n* Merge the Clark2Dt scenario into the AlmostInfinite scenario\r\n\r\n* Enable circle and rectangle origin sampling for both Normal and Clark2Dt dispersal in the AlmostInfinite scenario\r\n\r\n* Switch to using cuda-toolkit action in CI", "created_at": "2024-03-02T10:26:30Z", "repo": "necsim-rust", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cad7c26cad20a8b59a